WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.421 --> 00:00:02.838
(soft music)

00:00:05.328 --> 00:00:08.064
- I know it feels really bad right now.

00:00:08.064 --> 00:00:10.450
- I know I feel scared.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.654
And I feel alone.

00:00:11.654 --> 00:00:13.155
- Whatever you feel right now,

00:00:13.155 --> 00:00:15.002
the emotions, they're valid.

00:00:15.002 --> 00:00:17.880
- The only thing I can do is
stand here and tell you that

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:18.861
you're not alone.

00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:21.575
- All over the world, people
that you didn't even know

00:00:21.575 --> 00:00:22.777
are rooting for you.

00:00:22.777 --> 00:00:25.373
Are rooting for you, starting with me.

00:00:25.373 --> 00:00:28.305
- What makes you unique is
what makes you beautiful.

00:00:28.305 --> 00:00:29.814
It's what makes you lovable.

00:00:29.814 --> 00:00:31.205
It's what makes you incredible.

00:00:31.205 --> 00:00:33.515
- It's going to be really
easy right now to feel

00:00:33.515 --> 00:00:35.171
defeated and exhausted.

00:00:35.171 --> 00:00:38.686
- We are standing by you in
solidarity throughout this.

00:00:38.686 --> 00:00:41.376
- Now is the time where
it's really important

00:00:41.376 --> 00:00:43.317
for you to stand your ground and say,

00:00:43.317 --> 00:00:44.569
"This is who I am."

00:00:44.569 --> 00:00:48.289
- For every person that you run into

00:00:48.289 --> 00:00:51.104
who maybe believes that it's their right

00:00:51.104 --> 00:00:52.634
to treat you differently,

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:54.808
you're going to find so many other people

00:00:54.808 --> 00:00:56.584
who will treat you with
kindness and respect.

00:00:56.584 --> 00:00:57.957
- And you belong here.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:00.366
- And you can definitely
make a difference.

00:01:00.366 --> 00:01:03.086
- You have an inner strength
you don't even know is there.

00:01:03.086 --> 00:01:04.445
But I know it's there.

00:01:04.445 --> 00:01:07.279
- It just takes so much
work and so much patience.

00:01:07.279 --> 00:01:08.583
- You don't have to do this alone.

00:01:08.583 --> 00:01:10.801
- We are so with you.

00:01:10.801 --> 00:01:12.014
- We're with you.

00:01:12.014 --> 00:01:13.019
- We're with you.

00:01:13.019 --> 00:01:13.961
- We're with you.

00:01:13.961 --> 00:01:15.630
- And if America is
ever going to be great,

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:16.721
you're going to be the reason.

00:01:16.721 --> 00:01:18.041
- You are not powerless in this.

00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:19.939
You have the action to make change.

00:01:19.939 --> 00:01:22.141
- Read, engage, be veracious.

00:01:22.141 --> 00:01:23.645
Volunteer with your local groups.

00:01:23.645 --> 00:01:25.584
- Nothing is accomplished by giving up.

00:01:25.584 --> 00:01:26.819
- We might take one step back,

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:29.192
but we just have to take
two steps forward again.

00:01:29.192 --> 00:01:31.194
- This is not where we stop fighting,

00:01:31.194 --> 00:01:33.075
or loving, or hugging.

00:01:33.075 --> 00:01:35.236
- Things will get better,
because we are the ones

00:01:35.236 --> 00:01:37.365
that are going to make
sure that that happens.

00:01:37.365 --> 00:01:38.674
- The time is now.

00:01:38.674 --> 00:01:40.222
We don't need to wait another second.

00:01:40.222 --> 00:01:42.455
- Don't lie down and don't accept things

00:01:42.455 --> 00:01:44.254
that are not acceptable.

00:01:44.254 --> 00:01:45.934
- We will not fall prey to hate.

00:01:45.934 --> 00:01:47.898
- Good definitely still exists.

00:01:47.898 --> 00:01:48.731
- Puppies.

00:01:48.731 --> 00:01:49.564
- Puppies.

00:01:49.564 --> 00:01:50.397
- Puppies.

00:01:50.397 --> 00:01:51.260
(laughs)

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:53.123
- Kittens, have you seen a kitten lately?

00:01:53.123 --> 00:01:53.984
- And I love you.

00:01:53.984 --> 00:01:55.359
We love you.

00:01:55.359 --> 00:01:56.192
- We love you.

00:01:56.192 --> 00:01:57.025
- We love you.

00:01:57.025 --> 00:01:57.955
- We love you.

00:01:57.955 --> 00:01:59.260
- When people get set
back, that's when they

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:00.759
come back the strongest.

00:02:00.759 --> 00:02:02.642
- And we need to stand for the things,

00:02:02.642 --> 00:02:04.296
and for the people that we believe in.

00:02:04.296 --> 00:02:06.713
(soft music)

